== HONEST READING DECLARATIONS ============================================
- STATE MAP: the CARD's map governs (UNAFFORDABLE cost > green -> GREY;
  COMBAT phase -> RED on BUILDABLE rows; affordable+BUILD -> neutral).
  The older plan-row wording had the two halves worded swapped
  ("red when cost > green, grey when phase != build"); the card cites
  the DA-verified live phase writers (phase_controller.gd:69/78) for
  the combat->RED mapping and pins the test rows literally
  ("green-drilled-below-cost -> grey row", "combat-phase -> red rows").
  Card over plan wording — declared here, not silently chosen.
- OVERLAP (unaffordable AND combat): GREY wins — literal in the brief
  ("RED-tint the BUILDABLE rows": an unaffordable row is not buildable,
  so combat never paints it). The COMBAT leg runs all rows affordable,
  so no leg hides behind the overlap; the reading is in the source
  comment too.
- TINT CONSTS live in defense_rows_ui.gd, NOT sprite_bank.gd (plan
  wording): the card pathspec keeps the footprint to the rows file (+
  optional new file) — a sprite_bank edit would be a second governed-
  class file for three presentation constants. I2-safe: a Color
  string-hex is blanked by the BN1 pre-pass (the gate's own rule, one
  home), precedent: governed hud.gd ships _tint_down Color("6f6f6f")
  in the same shape. Hygiene 0 rows below pin it.
- THE PUMP: the plan W3 row planned "defense_panel.gd (one drive
  line)"; the card pathspec keeps defense_panel.gd byte-quiet, so the
  paint rides the hook the panel ALREADY calls every pump —
  rows_ui.sync_marks() from sync() (poll() AND refresh() both run it).
  The plan row itself names "the shipped W17e poll sync (defense_rows_ui
  sync pass precedent, sync_marks idiom)" as the mechanism — zero new
  pump lines exist anywhere. Cheap by the W17e contract: modulate is
  touched only where a row's tint actually changed.
- Presentation ONLY: both ENFORCEMENT legs re-run the shipped refusals
  UNDER the painted state (grey rows still answer why:"green", red rows
  why:"phase", green/list fixed, stderr EMPTY). NO cooldown states were
  added (plan cd-half REJECT honored); no new nodes/scripts; costs read
  row["cost"] (towers.json through picker_rows) — zero cost numbers
  re-declared.

